# ID       : LSYS-503B4C4FB57F
# Name     : Plant attacked by a depth-first-search insect
# Source   : Prusinkiewicz et al., L-systems: From the Theory to Visual Models of Plants (1996) | Equation 16 | https://algorithmicbotany.org/papers/l-sys.csiro96.pdf
# Formalism: parametric branch-context-sensitive L-system with endogenous mobile signal
# Parse    : pass; validator=corpus-static
# Execute  : not-run; target=attached-cpu
# Render   : unsupported; reason=unsupported render profile 'parametric-context-turtle2d'
# Fidelity : transcription
# Features : branch-context, context-sensitive, depth-first-search, mobile-signal, parametric
# Angle    : 45
